alues":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\r\n\r\n4.4.dev\r\n\r\n### System information\r\n\r\nWindows 11 - Vulkan (Forward+)\r\n\r\n### Issue description\r\n\r\nAfter https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/92554, I'm getting errors from `AnimationMixer`. They spam when it's an animation with capture tracks and only when `$AnimationPlayer.play(\"animation\")` is called then stop.\r\n\r\n> E 0:00:04:0571   AnimationMixer::_blend_calc_total_weight: No animation in cache.\r\n>   <C++ Error>    Condition \"!animation_track_num_to_track_cashe.has(a)\" is true. Continuing.\r\n>   <C++ Source>   godot\\scene/animation/animation_mixer.cpp:1109 @ AnimationMixer::_blend_calc_total_weight()\r\n> \r\n> E 0:00:04:0571   AnimationMixer::_blend_process: No animation in cache.\r\n>   <C++ Error>    Condition \"!animation_track_num_to_track_cashe.has(a)\" is true. Continuing.\r\n>   <C++ Source>   godot\\scene/animation/animation_mixer.cpp:1159 @ AnimationMixer::_blend_process()\r\n\r\n### Steps to reproduce\r\n\r\nThe MRP plays a \"deactivate\" animation which has capture tracks when pressing Enter.\r\n```gdscript\r\nfunc _input(event: InputEvent) -> void:\r\n\tif event.is_action_pressed(\"ui_accept\"):\r\n\t\t$AnimationPlayer.play(\"deactivate\")\r\n```\r\nPreviously, it would animate going to the deactivated pose as expected without errors.\r\nNow it skips the animation and instantly changes to the last frame of the \"deactivate\" while printing errors.\r\n> [!NOTE]\r\n> The errors don't occur if the animation is played from `AnimationTree`'s state machine. Enable `AnimationTree`'s `active` property, remove the `$AnimationPlayer.play(\"deactivate\")` and run the project to test.\r\n\r\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\r\n\r\n[animation-error.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/17588461/animation-error.zip)\r\n\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98647/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98647/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}